WEBVTT

00:00:02.430 --> 00:00:07.870
Infinite Ryvius

00:00:07.870 --> 00:00:10.170
We have a Darjeeling wave transmission
from the vicinity of Uranus!

00:00:10.170 --> 00:00:14.040
It appears that a gravitational wave warp
has occurred 1,580 zerades from Titania.

00:00:14.040 --> 00:00:16.780
The space curve ratio
is estimated at 9,700.

00:00:16.780 --> 00:00:18.340
That figure's a hundred times greater
than anything we've seen before.

00:00:18.340 --> 00:00:20.080
The Vaia is going out of control.

00:00:20.080 --> 00:00:23.010
Which is it? The Ryvius, or the Gespenst?

00:00:28.890 --> 00:00:31.120
<i>The speed is synched with that</i>
<i>of the enemy ship. Start approach.</i>

00:00:31.490 --> 00:00:40.270
<i>Spence, Caster, hold position.</i>

00:00:40.270 --> 00:00:44.000
Windy, take control of their electric power.
Circes, jam their main system.

00:00:44.670 --> 00:00:47.070
Once you take over the ship,
we'll move in to capture the Sphix.

00:00:50.780 --> 00:00:52.370
What's this mess?

00:00:54.880 --> 00:00:56.850
<i>Send me the Navigation Solid.</i>

00:00:57.250 --> 00:01:00.520
<i>Please. I want to go to the Lift Ship.</i>

00:01:01.590 --> 00:01:03.050
<i>Please cooperate with me.</i>

00:01:05.730 --> 00:01:08.020
<i>I must go there, no matter what.</i>

00:01:10.430 --> 00:01:11.920
<i>I need to get a message across.</i>

00:01:12.230 --> 00:01:14.430
- <i>I need to get a message across!</i>
- I need to get a message across...!

00:01:14.530 --> 00:01:18.970
Infinite Ryvius

00:01:18.970 --> 00:01:25.840
If you're going to walk, right here will be fine

00:01:26.850 --> 00:01:29.850
Although loneliness...

00:01:29.850 --> 00:01:34.180
...can sometimes be unbearable

00:01:34.690 --> 00:01:41.420
There's the benefit of not hurting anyone...

00:01:42.560 --> 00:01:46.500
...and the benefit of not being exposed...

00:01:46.500 --> 00:01:49.470
...and hurt by others as well

00:01:49.970 --> 00:01:57.000
At the opposite side of the frozen sea...

00:01:57.780 --> 00:02:00.780
...the dream and the reality...

00:02:00.780 --> 00:02:04.410
...that you saw cross paths

00:02:04.580 --> 00:02:08.110
Some light is shed...

00:02:08.790 --> 00:02:12.690
...but how it is done is unknown...

00:02:12.690 --> 00:02:19.930
...so that we can go to a different place

00:02:20.400 --> 00:02:27.930
The things I want have no shape

00:02:28.210 --> 00:02:36.340
Tear the final universe, today until tomorrow

00:02:47.190 --> 00:02:50.590
In Order to Stay as Myself

00:02:51.400 --> 00:02:54.100
Relative speed, 750!
Locked on, directly ahead!

00:02:54.100 --> 00:02:55.590
Make it there!

00:03:00.410 --> 00:03:01.670
It's no use. We're no match.

00:03:01.670 --> 00:03:04.140
The west barrel is no longer functioning,
due to over-usage!

00:03:04.140 --> 00:03:06.200
- Hey, what'll we do?
- Shift the field to an acute angle!

00:03:06.440 --> 00:03:07.850
We'll slice 'em up!

00:03:07.850 --> 00:03:09.870
That unscientific thing is coming at us.

00:03:10.880 --> 00:03:13.390
I won't acknowledge it.
I will not acknowledge it!

00:03:13.390 --> 00:03:14.610
Shadow of enemy on the Geduld surface!

00:03:16.720 --> 00:03:18.320
The enemy's also produced a field!

00:03:18.320 --> 00:03:20.660
A dogfight, here in outer space?

00:03:20.660 --> 00:03:23.630
- We can't avoid them!
- Damn!

00:03:26.260 --> 00:03:27.930
Second wave from straight ahead.

00:03:27.930 --> 00:03:29.370
The enemy Vital Guarder is coming!

00:03:34.040 --> 00:03:35.670
It's above us!

00:03:35.840 --> 00:03:37.310
They're asking for it!

00:03:41.550 --> 00:03:43.140
I'll crush you!

00:03:48.550 --> 00:03:50.820
The arm's been severed above the elbow!

00:03:50.960 --> 00:03:53.150
- No way!
- Ikumi...!

00:03:59.900 --> 00:04:01.370
Bastard!

00:04:06.600 --> 00:04:08.540
I'll tear you to pieces!

00:04:19.880 --> 00:04:22.610
Damn the Bratica!
What's happening with Carmine?

00:04:22.690 --> 00:04:24.660
The troops have successfully
boarded the ship.

00:04:24.660 --> 00:04:26.260
However, the Sphix has
not been found yet.

00:04:26.260 --> 00:04:29.590
Then we'll focus our attack
on the enemy Vital Guarder!

00:04:30.530 --> 00:04:33.990
<i>We'll leave no trace of it, or the Sphix.</i>

00:04:35.770 --> 00:04:37.000
Ume, hurry!

00:04:44.280 --> 00:04:45.710
My body!

00:04:49.080 --> 00:04:50.550
S-Stop it.

00:04:50.550 --> 00:04:52.520
Are you gonna kill us?

00:04:52.920 --> 00:04:54.540
Uncle John...!

00:04:55.190 --> 00:04:57.680
Do as you wish!
Kill me, if that's what you want!

00:04:57.960 --> 00:05:00.690
<i>We've done nothing wrong.</i>
<i>What were we supposed to do?</i>

00:05:00.690 --> 00:05:03.330
- <i>We didn't wanna die.</i>
- Kernel to Gibson. We've secured a child.

00:05:03.330 --> 00:05:04.930
- <i>There are things that we don't like.</i>
- Gibson here.

00:05:04.930 --> 00:05:06.360
- <i>What's wrong with that?</i>
- I've only found children as well.

00:05:06.360 --> 00:05:08.470
Windy's currently moving to
take control of the electric power.

00:05:08.470 --> 00:05:10.300
Proceed to the bridge,
in accordance with our plans.

00:05:10.300 --> 00:05:11.770
Roger.

00:05:12.640 --> 00:05:16.630
Please. Help me.
I'll do anything. Anything.

00:05:18.480 --> 00:05:22.110
No. Help, brother! Blue!

00:05:24.280 --> 00:05:26.270
The invading enemy has cut off
the power supply!

00:05:26.890 --> 00:05:28.850
They're also hacking into
our Navigation Solids.

00:05:29.050 --> 00:05:30.990
At this rate, there's the danger
of us losing steering control.

00:05:31.590 --> 00:05:33.680
Lower all partitions leading to the bridge!

00:05:34.190 --> 00:05:37.060
<i>Open the hatch. Please.</i>

00:05:38.030 --> 00:05:39.460
You're in no condition to go.

00:05:39.460 --> 00:05:43.660
<i>Please. Allow us to go. Kouji may be the</i>
<i>only one able to stop Ikumi and Yuki.</i>

00:05:43.940 --> 00:05:46.100
<i>And I also need to talk to someone.</i>

00:05:46.670 --> 00:05:48.510
<i>There's a girl on that ship</i>
<i>that I have to talk to!</i>

00:05:48.510 --> 00:05:49.340
But...!

00:05:50.040 --> 00:05:53.340
<i>Can I do this? Can I risk my life for this?</i>

00:05:53.750 --> 00:05:55.210
<i>All to get a message across to someone?</i>

00:05:57.020 --> 00:05:59.510
The Ryvius's rear is sinking into Geduld!

00:06:00.820 --> 00:06:03.980
We haven't activated a field! At
this rate, we'll be torn to pieces!

00:06:13.700 --> 00:06:17.130
<i>Kouji. I don't know of anything</i>
<i>more important than life.</i>

00:06:18.240 --> 00:06:21.230
<i>But if you insist there is something more</i>
<i>important to you, I will not stop you.</i>

00:06:21.940 --> 00:06:25.570
<i>But promise me one thing.</i>
<i>That you will return alive.</i>

00:06:28.850 --> 00:06:31.120
<i>I can only shoot you out in</i>
<i>the approximate direction.</i>

00:06:31.120 --> 00:06:33.550
- <i>Alter your course manually!</i>
- Will do.

00:06:33.690 --> 00:06:35.020
Hurry, Juli!

00:06:44.500 --> 00:06:48.430
<i>Lkumi. Kozue. Yuki. Faina.</i>

00:06:49.270 --> 00:06:51.430
<i>Where are you? Where are you guys?</i>

00:06:53.640 --> 00:06:55.230
Kouji. Look!

00:07:10.120 --> 00:07:11.520
Our course...!

00:07:12.120 --> 00:07:13.490
It's being adjusted.

00:07:23.030 --> 00:07:24.970
- It's still alive.
- There's no end to this!

00:07:24.970 --> 00:07:26.670
Our East side is out of shots!

00:07:26.670 --> 00:07:30.610
With the help of Geduld...
and those creatures, they're recovering.

00:07:31.340 --> 00:07:35.970
And it's taking on a fully developed form.
How come? That's impossible!

00:07:36.920 --> 00:07:39.580
Please, Ikumi! Show me a future!

00:07:40.850 --> 00:07:42.840
A Ryvius work pod is headed this way!

00:07:43.050 --> 00:07:45.360
- Did someone not escape in time?
- I'll leave the hatch open!

00:07:45.360 --> 00:07:47.980
Who's the fool! Could it be...?

00:07:49.930 --> 00:07:51.900
The partition to S-23 has been destroyed!

00:07:52.200 --> 00:07:53.700
That's not far from here!

00:07:53.700 --> 00:07:56.690
If this ship sinks, we'll all die.
Guard the bridge with your lives...

00:07:57.200 --> 00:07:58.670
...no matter what it takes.

00:08:05.680 --> 00:08:07.650
- Blue!
- Huh?

00:08:07.650 --> 00:08:09.110
W-We're saved.

00:08:12.050 --> 00:08:16.650
Everyone, stack up the equipment
to block the entrance!

00:08:17.090 --> 00:08:18.860
Wait! Please. Stay here!

00:08:18.860 --> 00:08:21.830
- Don't give me orders.
- This isn't an order!

00:08:21.830 --> 00:08:23.700
I want you to stay here with me!

00:08:23.700 --> 00:08:27.060
What is it that you must do right now?

00:08:32.170 --> 00:08:34.240
Juli. The enemy is still around.

00:08:34.240 --> 00:08:36.330
If they take over the bridge,
we're doomed.

00:08:36.640 --> 00:08:37.440
But...!

00:08:37.440 --> 00:08:39.140
I can't allow him to go out there
alone to defend against them.

00:08:39.580 --> 00:08:41.070
I'll go out to greet them as well.

00:08:43.110 --> 00:08:45.840
- Pat. Can I rely on you to protect Juli?
- Sure.

00:08:46.950 --> 00:08:50.250
- I'll go too. I want to protect you.
- Charlie...!

00:08:50.560 --> 00:08:52.520
- Count me in.
- M-Me too.

00:08:52.820 --> 00:08:54.090
I-I'll go too.

00:08:54.230 --> 00:08:56.790
- Okay, let's go!
- Yeah!

00:08:57.100 --> 00:08:58.560
Johnson...!

00:08:59.000 --> 00:09:02.730
- Lucson's really cool.
- Yeah. You're looking at a true Zwei.

00:09:05.240 --> 00:09:06.770
I'm not afraid!

00:09:06.770 --> 00:09:10.940
I've got nothing more to lose!

00:09:12.410 --> 00:09:14.380
I've locked onto the Lift Ship's point.

00:09:14.650 --> 00:09:16.170
- Aoi.
- Don't speak.

00:09:16.710 --> 00:09:18.680
No, let me say something. Aoi.

00:09:19.980 --> 00:09:26.180
You know that my parents divorced
when we were still little, right?

00:09:27.830 --> 00:09:30.060
I was over-eager.

00:09:30.060 --> 00:09:33.360
I felt that I had to do something. I had to.

00:09:36.300 --> 00:09:39.760
And I continued believing that for ten years,
so I lost touch with myself.

00:09:41.270 --> 00:09:43.830
And things just got worse
after Yuki beat me up.

00:09:44.710 --> 00:09:47.650
I always thought "never mind",
things will smooth over if I'm patient.

00:09:47.650 --> 00:09:49.980
I began thinking that it couldn't be helped.

00:09:51.880 --> 00:09:53.580
But that doesn't solve anything.

00:09:54.320 --> 00:09:56.290
I finally realize that.

00:09:56.920 --> 00:10:00.910
It took an unbelievably long time,
but I finally realize that.

00:10:01.360 --> 00:10:03.330
If you realize it,
then we've gotta move forward.

00:10:04.460 --> 00:10:06.760
Nothing's happened in our relationship yet.

00:10:07.000 --> 00:10:09.060
- We haven't even gone out on a date.
- Right.

00:10:16.610 --> 00:10:17.980
Einvalt's approaching.

00:10:17.980 --> 00:10:19.940
Those kids don't know
what they're up against!

00:10:20.180 --> 00:10:22.770
Once Geist has returned,
direct all of our output at it!

00:10:24.780 --> 00:10:26.340
<i>Geist and Tacran are connected!</i>

00:10:26.650 --> 00:10:29.710
<i>Yuri, Sakurai,</i>
<i>raise the yield rate to 120%!</i>

00:10:29.920 --> 00:10:31.890
Kouji! What's that?

00:10:31.890 --> 00:10:33.360
We can't afford to pay attention to it.

00:10:38.930 --> 00:10:40.730
This could be trouble!
Bring back the Vital Guarder!

00:10:40.930 --> 00:10:43.420
We're not gonna make it!
I'm gonna fully develop our field!

00:10:43.630 --> 00:10:44.770
I'm closing the hatch!

00:10:44.770 --> 00:10:47.170
<i>Working pod, hurry in!</i>
<i>You could get sucked into the attack!</i>

00:10:48.170 --> 00:10:49.140
Kouji!

00:10:54.510 --> 00:10:56.480
Disintegrate!

00:11:05.090 --> 00:11:06.990
No!

00:11:12.630 --> 00:11:13.960
Infinite Ryvius

00:11:17.600 --> 00:11:18.500
Infinite Ryvius

00:11:21.570 --> 00:11:23.840
<i>Hey, we've lost transmission!</i>

00:11:23.840 --> 00:11:25.180
Have we been hit directly?

00:11:25.180 --> 00:11:28.170
Ikumi! What's going on?
Damn. I can't connect.

00:11:28.750 --> 00:11:30.580
And the hatch remains closed.

00:11:30.680 --> 00:11:32.580
Hey! What are you guys thinking?

00:11:32.580 --> 00:11:34.420
You planning to abandon us?

00:11:34.420 --> 00:11:36.050
W-Wait a minute.

00:11:36.890 --> 00:11:39.660
I'll adjust the
gravitational field to maximum!

00:11:39.660 --> 00:11:41.650
We'll finish the Vital Guarder off.

00:11:41.790 --> 00:11:45.460
I'll sink you. I'll crush you.
There won't be anything left of you!

00:11:54.770 --> 00:11:56.170
Stop this nonsense.

00:11:56.610 --> 00:11:57.730
Please.

00:11:58.480 --> 00:12:01.410
Everyone's sad. Everyone's crying.

00:12:02.010 --> 00:12:03.980
Everyone's anxious.

00:12:04.380 --> 00:12:07.820
There's no meaning in what you're doing.
No meaning at all.

00:12:08.590 --> 00:12:09.420
Please.

00:12:18.060 --> 00:12:20.220
<i>E.M. Results... counter effects are gone!</i>

00:12:20.460 --> 00:12:24.090
<i>The first demonstration is over.</i>
<i>Geist... taking off!</i>

00:12:27.670 --> 00:12:28.740
The enemy's coming!

00:12:28.740 --> 00:12:30.710
Send over A-54 and TK-72.

00:12:31.140 --> 00:12:32.870
Spread a field around the
Lift Ship as well.

00:12:33.640 --> 00:12:35.810
We'll be all right. Yuki!

00:12:35.810 --> 00:12:36.780
Damn it!

00:12:53.530 --> 00:12:55.000
I'll crush you.

00:12:55.730 --> 00:12:57.440
If I'm gonna have to die anyway...

00:12:57.440 --> 00:12:59.540
...I'll put up a fight and smash
the Vital Guarder against it.

00:12:59.540 --> 00:13:00.940
GO!

00:13:02.640 --> 00:13:04.700
None of what you're doing...

00:13:05.240 --> 00:13:07.210
...is at all enjoyable.

00:13:11.850 --> 00:13:13.110
- You're kidding!
- The fields!

00:13:13.950 --> 00:13:16.480
- Captain! The puppet wires
are being severed!

00:13:16.990 --> 00:13:19.150
Damn! I can't control anything!

00:13:39.840 --> 00:13:41.810
- Hang in there.
- I know.

00:13:44.550 --> 00:13:45.570
- Aoi.
- Huh?

00:13:49.990 --> 00:13:50.950
Kouji!

00:13:52.760 --> 00:13:54.530
What are you doing, Kouji?

00:13:54.530 --> 00:13:55.690
You stay here.

00:13:55.690 --> 00:14:00.000
Why? I have something to tell Kozue.
Open it, Kouji.

00:14:00.000 --> 00:14:02.990
Sorry. This injury of mine...!

00:14:03.870 --> 00:14:08.540
I was shot by Ikumi. So... sorry.

00:14:08.540 --> 00:14:13.940
No way, Kouji. Kouji! Open the door, Kouji!
I'm begging you to open it!

00:14:15.510 --> 00:14:16.980
There's no response from Geist.

00:14:17.550 --> 00:14:19.520
The enemy also remains silent.

00:14:19.720 --> 00:14:20.920
What about the Bratica?

00:14:20.920 --> 00:14:24.120
We've succeeded in taking over the ship,
but not the Sphix.

00:14:24.920 --> 00:14:26.690
Maximum speed ahead!

00:14:26.690 --> 00:14:30.130
We'll use the sheer mass of the Grey
Gespenst to hammer the enemy to pieces!

00:14:30.130 --> 00:14:32.720
Captain! Our orders are to capture it!

00:14:33.160 --> 00:14:34.570
We mustn't repeat the
folly made by the Impulse!

00:14:34.570 --> 00:14:36.060
I'm giving out the orders here!

00:14:36.230 --> 00:14:37.670
Wait!

00:14:42.910 --> 00:14:44.170
You... couldn't be...!

00:14:51.480 --> 00:14:53.070
Stop it.

00:14:57.790 --> 00:14:59.290
What'll we do now?

00:14:59.290 --> 00:15:01.430
Can we get to Titania in this state?

00:15:01.430 --> 00:15:02.890
You're being too reckless.

00:15:03.960 --> 00:15:06.130
- If we hadn't fought, we'd be dead.
- Chic!

00:15:06.130 --> 00:15:08.330
- How dare you!
- Stop it! Don't fight!

00:15:09.330 --> 00:15:12.270
Just try and fire that thing!
There's no way you can fire that! Can you?

00:15:12.740 --> 00:15:13.570
No!

00:15:19.780 --> 00:15:22.140
- Ikumi.
- He really shot him.

00:15:24.080 --> 00:15:26.610
That's right. We must eliminate
all elements causing unrest.

00:15:27.180 --> 00:15:29.150
We're gonna protect everyone,
no matter what.

00:15:30.350 --> 00:15:32.320
Anyone against that can step forward!

00:15:39.300 --> 00:15:40.260
Kouji!

00:15:42.370 --> 00:15:45.390
But you died!
I'm positive that Ange died!

00:15:51.440 --> 00:15:55.970
What's this?
You used Ange to become a Sphix?

00:16:00.480 --> 00:16:02.040
You're only an imitation!

00:16:09.230 --> 00:16:10.690
<i>Father.</i>

00:16:14.330 --> 00:16:15.800
Attention to all crew.

00:16:16.030 --> 00:16:20.440
The people aboard the Ryvius
are all children. Rescue them.

00:16:21.270 --> 00:16:24.300
I'm leaving you in charge
from this point on.

00:16:30.050 --> 00:16:32.170
He's gonna die! He'll die!

00:16:32.520 --> 00:16:36.510
Why, Yuki? I can't have this!

00:16:37.220 --> 00:16:39.620
I don't want it to happen this way!

00:16:42.360 --> 00:16:43.350
Go to him.

00:16:48.170 --> 00:16:50.330
Everyone. Let's surrender.

00:16:51.470 --> 00:16:52.960
Right now, that's our best option.

00:16:54.040 --> 00:16:56.010
But the enemy's seriously
trying to knock us off!

00:16:56.410 --> 00:16:59.070
I know. But I still believe
we should surrender.

00:17:00.110 --> 00:17:02.050
Ikumi, we can't continue this any longer.

00:17:02.180 --> 00:17:05.050
- Are you outta your mind?
- Still trying to be "Mr. Goodguy"?

00:17:05.550 --> 00:17:09.320
Why do you insist?
Our future is almost visible.

00:17:09.590 --> 00:17:11.020
Are you still tied down by your past...?

00:17:11.020 --> 00:17:15.420
We cannot part with our past.
I am who I am today because I have a past.

00:17:16.660 --> 00:17:19.530
Faina, even if you've had
difficulties in the past...

00:17:20.360 --> 00:17:23.130
...isn't it right to feed on those
experiences to face the future?

00:17:25.070 --> 00:17:26.540
You're wrong!

00:17:27.040 --> 00:17:30.030
Ikumi, shoot him!
Allow me to cut off my past!

00:17:31.280 --> 00:17:33.240
You cannot cut off your past.

00:17:33.780 --> 00:17:35.750
Your past will never disappear.

00:17:42.250 --> 00:17:45.190
You knew all along. Mother Arne's...!

00:17:45.860 --> 00:17:48.380
I... I...!

00:17:50.460 --> 00:17:52.160
This place is warped.

00:17:52.160 --> 00:17:55.890
Someone here abandoned Aoi,
me and others back on the Ryvius.

00:17:56.430 --> 00:17:58.090
What did you say? Where's Aoi?

00:17:58.700 --> 00:18:01.570
She's here. She's safe.

00:18:01.740 --> 00:18:03.710
Who did this?

00:18:04.680 --> 00:18:07.910
I-It was the best option
under the circumstances.

00:18:09.150 --> 00:18:11.840
It's impossible that I'd make a mistake!
Please stop looking at me like that!

00:18:12.050 --> 00:18:14.020
Damn you!

00:18:15.650 --> 00:18:17.350
Now you know, Ikumi.

00:18:18.490 --> 00:18:21.250
There are guys who will do things like this,
without your knowledge.

00:18:22.290 --> 00:18:24.060
There are still more people on the Ryvius.

00:18:24.330 --> 00:18:26.030
Fine! So you want me to rescue them!

00:18:26.030 --> 00:18:30.060
Under the current system,
you'll never achieve your ideal.

00:18:30.330 --> 00:18:32.390
Are you saying that I'm mistaken?

00:18:35.610 --> 00:18:38.280
I don't wanna live in obstinacy.

00:18:38.280 --> 00:18:40.380
I wanna do as I wish.

00:18:40.380 --> 00:18:44.420
Although I may make mistakes,
feel down, or become angry.

00:18:44.420 --> 00:18:47.080
I feel it's okay even if I'm like that.

00:18:48.350 --> 00:18:50.550
Even if I should feel hurt...

00:18:51.090 --> 00:18:54.180
...I don't wanna hurt others.

00:18:55.660 --> 00:18:58.130
So... let's surrender, Ikumi.

00:18:58.630 --> 00:19:01.390
How could you say something so stupid?
We could get killed, you know!

00:19:02.770 --> 00:19:06.140
- Stop laughing!
- Right now, I wanna laugh.

00:19:06.140 --> 00:19:08.100
What are you saying?

00:19:08.710 --> 00:19:11.200
Guys like you aren't
supposed to appear before me.

00:19:12.340 --> 00:19:17.470
It's no good. Please understand, Kouji!

00:19:17.950 --> 00:19:19.050
