- You mustn't!

00:19:19.050 --> 00:19:20.910
Shut up!

00:19:23.220 --> 00:19:24.410
Nooo!!

00:19:27.630 --> 00:19:31.290
Kouji! Don't die! Please!

00:19:32.300 --> 00:19:34.570
- Aoi.
- Stop it, Ikumi!

00:19:34.570 --> 00:19:36.100
Stay there!

00:19:36.100 --> 00:19:39.190
The enemy's still out there.
I have to protect everyone!

00:19:39.770 --> 00:19:41.740
I have to protect Kozue!

00:19:42.010 --> 00:19:44.600
All this guy does is promote
unnecessary disorder! That's why...!

00:19:45.240 --> 00:19:48.340
You're confident that you're
right about this, are you, Ikumi?

00:19:48.610 --> 00:19:50.180
Die for our sake.

00:19:50.180 --> 00:19:53.380
If you're right... and I am mistaken...!

00:19:55.820 --> 00:19:57.840
You fool! He's your brother!

00:19:58.160 --> 00:19:59.420
Nooo!!

00:19:59.420 --> 00:20:00.360
KOUJI!

00:20:04.190 --> 00:20:05.960
Don't stop me!

00:20:06.860 --> 00:20:10.530
Stop it, Yuki.
Let Ikumi do as he wishes.

00:20:11.170 --> 00:20:13.360
- You serious?
- Please.

00:20:20.140 --> 00:20:23.410
- Stop it right there! It's over!
- We've been rescued!

00:20:27.280 --> 00:20:30.280
Rescued? Did you say rescued?

00:20:31.790 --> 00:20:33.760
Why would such a thing happen now?

00:20:34.690 --> 00:20:39.790
You can relax now. I'm sorry. Thank you.

00:20:43.300 --> 00:20:46.100
I... I...!

00:20:46.100 --> 00:20:48.070
My sister committed suicide, and...!

00:20:48.370 --> 00:20:50.430
We loved each other,
but it wasn't permitted...

00:20:51.640 --> 00:20:55.240
...so I vowed that next time I'd protect...!

00:20:55.780 --> 00:20:57.750
Therefore... therefore...!

00:21:24.610 --> 00:21:29.180
<i>If you're going to walk,</i>

00:21:29.180 --> 00:21:30.610
<i>right here will be fine.</i>
<i>Here's an update on the case known as</i>
<i>the Ryvius Incident that claimed many victims.</i>

00:21:30.610 --> 00:21:34.350
<i>Right here will be fine.</i>
<i>Last night, Vice-Minister Sergei</i>
<i>Berkovich of the Orbital Security Bureau...</i>

00:21:34.350 --> 00:21:37.350
<i>Although loneliness...</i>
<i>... who had been retained as a chief suspect</i>
<i>for allegations of accidental homicide...</i>

00:21:37.350 --> 00:21:40.590
<i>...can sometimes be unbearable</i>
<i>... who had been retained as a chief suspect</i>
